ot, CLIPLoader type minimax nvfp4_awq, MiniMaxH3ImageConditioning, CFGGuider 1.0 with ConditioningZeroOut negative, BasicScheduler simple 6, SplitSigmas 3, er_sde then SamplerLCM 0.95/0.90 with DisableNoise; 33 MP: ImageScale lanczos, VAEEncode, KSamplerAdvanced euler simple 6 steps from step 4, same seed and conditioning). Joined into one graph: nodes 41-44 are the second pass, pruned at 16 MP and below (PreviewImage 9 then reads VAEDecode 8). Changed: the prompt comes from PrimitiveStringMultiline 4, PreviewAny 90 echoes it, PreviewImage (temp) instead of a saved file, the seed and size are set by the Suite. Model card: MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-H3-Image@8ced60068623def5b74b4d10558117cb61d6482d (6 steps, no CFG, 16 MP sizes).","path":"MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-H3-Image@8ced60068623def5b74b4d10558117cb61d6482d/README.md"},"workflow":{"api_sha256":"9e3d58d2c84512aee2e353620c8b70652f12c7daa7ede272a095cb7d979d37b0","node_count":22}}